  "consentimientoSeccionVivoTitulo": "Live view at any time",
  "consentimientoSeccionVivoResumen": "Whenever the family wants",
  "consentimientoSeccionVivoTexto": "The linked family can watch the person live whenever they want, not only during an alert. Every access is logged: who, when and for how long.",
  "consentimientoSeccionHacemosTitulo": "What we do",
  "consentimientoSeccionHacemosResumen": "Falls detected from posture",
  "consentimientoSeccionHacemosTexto": "The home PC analyzes posture to detect falls and unstable movements. The continuous video never leaves the home. Only the notice and the clip of each alert leave it, plus the live view while someone in the family is watching it.",
  "consentimientoSeccionNoHacemosTitulo": "What we don't do",
  "consentimientoSeccionNoHacemosResumen": "No faces, no continuous recording",
  "consentimientoSeccionNoHacemosTexto": "No facial recognition and no continuous recording. The live view is not saved.",
  "consentimientoSeccionGuardamosTitulo": "What we store",
  "consentimientoSeccionGuardamosResumen": "Clip of each alert, 30 days",
  "consentimientoSeccionGuardamosTexto": "Only the clip of each alert, for 30 days; then it is deleted. It is stored in Microsoft Azure (Azure Blob Storage, Chile Central region), on servers outside Peru: this is a cross-border flow of personal data. Their movements (body points, no image) are stored only with a separate permission.",
  "consentimientoSeccionDerechosTitulo": "Their rights",
  "consentimientoSeccionDerechosResumen": "Law No. 29733 · revocable",
  "consentimientoSeccionDerechosTexto": "Under Law No. 29733, they can view, correct or delete their data, object to its use and revoke this consent.",
  "consentimientoRegistroTitulo": "How it is recorded",
  "consentimientoRegistroTexto": "We store who gave it, who recorded it, and the date and time (Law No. 29733).",
  "legalTerminosQueEsTitulo": "What Te Tengo is",
  "legalTerminosQueEsTexto": "It alerts your family if the home camera detects a possible fall or an unstable movement. It is not a security camera.",
  "legalTerminosCuentaTitulo": "Your account",
  "legalTerminosCuentaTexto1": "Only the owner (who creates it) changes the cared-for person's details, the consent, the rooms, the family and the alert order.",
  "legalTerminosCuentaTexto2": "Each account cares for a single person. Password of 8 characters or more, with a number; 5 failed attempts lock access for 15 minutes.",
  "legalTerminosInvitadosTitulo": "Invited family members",
  "legalTerminosInvitadosTexto": "They see alerts, clips, history and the live view; they mark alerts and pause the camera. The owner can remove their access.",
  "legalTerminosConsentimientoTitulo": "Consent",
  "legalTerminosConsentimientoTexto1": "Without the consent of the cared-for person or their legal representative, the camera sends no video. Revoking it stops capture and deletes the recordings.",
  "legalTerminosConsentimientoTexto2": "Storing their movements needs a separate, optional permission; alerts work the same without it.",
  "legalTerminosAlertasTitulo": "Alerts",
  "legalTerminosAlertasTexto": "All linked family members receive them. If the primary contact does not mark one within the waiting time (3, 5 or 10 minutes), we notify the secondary contact.",
  "legalTerminosLimitesTitulo": "Service limits",
  "legalTerminosLimitesTexto1": "No detection while the home PC is off or the camera is disconnected, paused or without consent; it is not reliable if it cannot see the person well.",
  "legalTerminosLimitesTexto2": "With the app closed, alerts arrive only if notifications are turned on.",
  "legalPoliticaDatosTitulo": "What data we store",
  "legalPoliticaDatosTexto1": "Account: name, email and password.",
  "legalPoliticaDatosTexto2": "Cared-for person: name, age, address and who they live with.",
  "legalPoliticaDatosTexto3": "Alerts: type, room, date, time and who responded.",
  "legalPoliticaVideoTitulo": "Video",
  "legalPoliticaVideoTexto1": "It is analyzed on the home PC. No facial recognition and no video in the cloud.",
  "legalPoliticaVideoTexto2": "Only the notice and the clip of each alert leave the home, plus the live view while someone in the family watches it with consent in effect.",
  "legalPoliticaVideoTexto3": "Only the clip of each alert (6 s before and 6 s after), for 30 days. The live view is not recorded.",
  "legalPoliticaMovimientosTitulo": "Movements",
  "legalPoliticaMovimientosTexto1": "Only with a separate, optional permission: body points (shoulders, hips, knees…), with no image or video.",
  "legalPoliticaMovimientosTexto2": "On the home PC and, if the owner chooses, in the cloud, from 7 days to 1 year. Withdrawing the permission deletes the ones in the cloud; the PC asks whether to delete its own too.",
  "legalPoliticaDondeTitulo": "Where it is stored",
  "legalPoliticaDondeTexto": "Clips and movements in the cloud are stored in Microsoft Azure (Azure Blob Storage, Chile Central region), on servers outside Peru: this is a cross-border flow of personal data.",
  "legalPoliticaQuienTitulo": "Who sees the data",
  "legalPoliticaQuienTexto": "Only the linked family. Every live access and every replay is kept in a log that everyone sees: who, when and for how long.",
  "legalPoliticaRevocarTitulo": "Revoking consent",
  "legalPoliticaRevocarTexto": "It stops capture and the live view and deletes the recordings; we send you the record.",
  "legalPoliticaDerechosTitulo": "Your rights",
  "legalPoliticaDerechosTexto": "View, correct or delete your data, or object to its use (Law No. 29733): privacidad@tetengo.pe.",
